From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ppenguin <hieronymusv@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 17:05:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] chore(ui): drop the IceWhale community links and the blog
 news feed

The dashboard still pointed users at IceWhale's channels for a project
IceWhale no longer ships: feedback to IceWhaleTech/CasaOS issues, their
Discord (contact bar and the "Smarten up your home" card), the CasaOS
wiki, awesome.casaos.io, and social-share buttons advertising the
IceWhale repository. Questions about this fork do not belong there.

The optional news feed went further than a link: when enabled, BrandBar
read /var/lib/casaos/baseinfo.conf (device identifiers), base64-encoded
it with the UI language, and sent it as a query key to
blog-casaos.zimaspace.com on every dashboard load. The feed, its
settings switch and the one-off consent dialog after onboarding are
removed; the brand bar shows the logo and credit line only.

Removed: ContactBar, FeedbackPanel, ShareModal, SmartBlock components;
the news-feed switch in the dashboard settings; "More"/help links to
awesome.casaos.io in app-store sources; "Free up storage" wiki links;
the share block in the update-complete modal.

Kept: the app icon CDN (icon.casaos.io) and the App Store catalogue,
which are functional; message-bus event type names.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
